@cc [owner:fontanierh,label:architecture] soundbank-saved-type-boundary
Soundbank saved definitions MUST remain data-only and MUST NOT link this module to Skate gameplay
or its simulation closure. Their generic Skate asset reference MUST be cast and validated by the
game's runtime selector before activation; an editor class filter MUST NOT be treated as validation.
The source manifest identity MUST be checked against the current staged registry before a world bank
is selected. A data asset or footstep-only preflight alone MUST NOT certify the entire bank.
